/*
  AutomationCard.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0082 · AutomationCard (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface (table "AutomationCard").
  Every key the native AutomationCard resolves lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the EXACT keys extracted from the web source
  (web/src/features/automations/pages/AutomationCard.tsx). The web i18next
  `{{name}}` interpolation is expressed natively as `%@` (resolved with
  String(format:)). The remaining keys back the native chrome (relative time,
  pin affordance, freshness chip, and the load/empty/error states the P4 state
  list requires).
*/

